<title>SWEDEN: Den Danske quits as authorised Sweden bond dealer.</title>
<headline>Den Danske quits as authorised Sweden bond dealer.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Friday Den Danske Bank would no longer be an authorised dealer of Swedish government bonds as of August 4.</p>
<p>&quot;According to Den Danske Bank the decision should be seen as a logical consequence of the bank's purchase of Consensus Fondkommission, which is already an authorised dealer for the National Debt Office,&quot; the office said in a statement.</p>
<p>The National Debt Office now has seven banks and four securities houses as authorised dealers.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
